  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "おおきくて　がんじょうな　ハンマーをつくるために　キリキザンの　むれをおそって　きんぞくを　あつめる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "크고 튼튼한 해머를 만들기 위해 절각참 무리를 습격해서 금속을 모은다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "為了製作又大又堅固的錘子，會去襲擊劈斬司令的群體，藉以收集金屬。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon attaque des cohortes de Scalpion et de Scalproie pour rassembler le métal nécessaire à la confection d’un grand marteau robuste.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es überfällt Gruppen von Gladiantri und Caesurio, um Metall zu sammeln, das es zum Herstellen seines großen, robusten Hammers benötigt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Asalta el séquito entero de un Bisharp para reunir metal con el que forjar su enorme y robusto martillo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Assalta i branchi capeggiati da Bisharp per procurarsi il metallo necessario a realizzare il suo martello grande e resistente.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon will attack groups of Pawniard and Bisharp, gathering metal from them in order to create a large and sturdy hammer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "大きくて　頑丈な　ハンマーを作るために　キリキザンの　群れを襲って　金属を　集める。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "为了制造又大又坚固的锤子，会去袭击劈斩司令的群体然后收集金属。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Asalta el séquito entero de un Bisharp para reunir metal con el que forjar su enorme y robusto martillo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "きんぞくの　ガラクタやまが　すみか。ハンマーの　きょうどを　ためすため！\u0004\u0006仲間同士なかまどうし仲間同士で　はげしく　うちあう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "금속으로 가득한 고철더미를 거처로 삼는다. 해머의 강도를 시험하기 위해 동료끼리 격렬하게 부딪친다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "棲息在堆滿破銅爛鐵的地方。為了測試錘子的強度，會和夥伴們激烈地敲打彼此。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon vit dans des tas de ferraille. Pour tester la force de ses marteaux, il les cogne contre ceux de ses congénères.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sie wohnen in Haufen aus Metallschrott. Um die Stärke ihrer Hämmer zu testen, schlagen sie diese kräftig gegeneinander.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Convierte montañas de chatarra en su guarida. Estos Pokémon suelen medir la fuerza de sus martillos golpeándolos contra los de los demás.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nidifica in montagne di ferraglia e testa la forza del proprio martello battendolo violentemente contro quello dei propri simili.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "These Pokémon make their homes in piles of scrap metal. They test the strength of each other’s hammers by smashing them together.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
